ed raw CV); the file itself is never\nstored anywhere.", "operationId": "submit_profile_cv_file_profile_cv_file_post", "parameters": [{"name": "description", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Description"}}, {"name": "additional_experience", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Additional Experience"}}], "requestBody": {"required": true, "content": {"multipart/form-data": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_submit_profile_cv_file_profile_cv_file_post"}}}}, "responses": {"202": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunQueuedResponse"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/segments": {"get": {"summary": "Segments", "operationId": "segments_segments_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/SegmentsResponse"}}}}}}}, "/discovery/preview": {"get": {"summary": "Discovery Preview", "operationId": "discovery_preview_discovery_preview_get", "parameters": [{"name": "max_baseline_queries", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Max Baseline Queries"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/DiscoveryPreviewResponse"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}}, "components": {"schemas": {"AdditionalExperienceRequest": {"properties": {"additional_experience": {"type": "string", "title": "Additional Experience"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["additional_experience"], "title": "AdditionalExperienceRequest", "description": "Stand-alone write of the supplementary-experience text.\n\nSplit from ``ProfileCvRequest`` so editing it does not require re-uploading\na CV. The value is stored byte-identical to what the user wrote."}, "AdditionalExperienceResponse": {"properties": {"additional_experience": {"type": "string", "title": "Additional Experience"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["additional_experience"], "title": "AdditionalExperienceResponse"}, "Body_submit_profile_cv_file_profile_cv_file_post": {"properties": {"file": {"type": "string", "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream", "title": "File"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["file"], "title": "Body_submit_profile_cv_file_profile_cv_file_post"}, "CompanyBatchReview": {"properties": {"company_ids": {"items": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "array", "maxItems": 500, "minItems": 1, "title": "Company Ids"}, "status": {"type": "string", "enum": ["accepted", "rejected"], "title": "Status"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["company_ids", "status"], "title": "CompanyBatchReview", "description": "The demo review screen's bulk accept/reject (plan-source-runs \u00a7API).\n\nStatus only: no ``careers_url``, no notes. Repeated ids are collapsed by the\ncore function; the request cap keeps one call inside one bounded\ntransaction."}, "CompanyCounts": {"properties": {"by_status": {"additionalProperties": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "object", "title": "By Status"}, "by_country": {"additionalProperties": {"type": "integer"}, "type": "object", "title": "By Country"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["by_status", "by_country"], "title": "CompanyCounts"}, "CompanyCreate": {"properties": {"name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "title": "Name"}, "careers_url": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "title": "Careers Url"}, "notes": {"type": "string", "title": "Notes", "default": ""}, "country": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Country"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["nam